WEBVTT

1
00:00:11,950 --> 00:00:12,850
Makikawa brother

2
00:00:12,990 --> 00:00:14,190
There just was an avalanche

3
00:00:14,350 --> 00:00:15,550
Even half of the mountain collapsed

4
00:00:15,830 --> 00:00:16,950
How dangerous this place is

5
00:00:17,590 --> 00:00:18,950
Let's come all the way here

6
00:00:19,190 --> 00:00:25,250
What exactly are you digging for? Meat.

7
00:00:25,410 --> 00:00:27,490
Why does meat grow underground? Brother Makikawa

8
00:00:27,690 --> 00:00:29,610
Did you make a mistake? Although I shovel flesh with my eyes

9
00:00:29,610 --> 00:00:30,570
Both eyes turned green

10
00:00:30,770 --> 00:00:37,280
But if you can find meat in this world of ice and snow, come with me. Just dig down here. Don’t take a look. Slow down.

11
00:00:37,640 --> 00:00:39,240
Stop digging when you get to the level close to the ground.

12
00:00:39,400 --> 00:00:51,410
This is where we dug up a rabbit.

13
00:00:51,610 --> 00:00:52,530
Now there is meat to eat

14
00:00:52,770 --> 00:00:54,210
I haven’t had a wedding in a few months.
